  ('gurgaon', 'Gurgaon', 'Gurugram', 'Haryana', '["Delhi","Noida","Faridabad","Rewari"]'::jsonb, 'Care in Gurgaon is given at partner hospitals, day-care centres and clinics. Most people come from Delhi, Noida, Faridabad or Rewari.', '[{"citySlug":"delhi","lead":"Planning from South or East Delhi? Read","tail":"for local travel and price notes."}]'::jsonb, true),
