s":[{"from":"Barabanki","time":"40 to 70 min","tip":"Easy for a same-day visit"},{"from":"Unnao","time":"60 to 100 min","tip":"Book an early slot to avoid afternoon heat"},{"from":"Sitapur","time":"80 to 120 min","tip":"Combine with shopping or a family visit"},{"from":"Hardoi","time":"100 to 150 min","tip":"Plan a full day, with a cap for the return"}],"privacyNote":"In a smaller town a neighbour may recognise you at a clinic. A short session need not be explained. Ask the clinic not to name the session on messages and reminders.","mapCaption":"Travel into Lucknow from nearby districts, no building shown."}'::jsonb, '[{"text":"NEEDS REAL DATA: which Lucknow facility, if any, will provide hydrafacial sessions","source":"","asOf":""},{"text":"NEEDS REAL DATA: Lucknow climate normals for heat, humidity and fog (IMD)","source":"","asOf":""},{"text":"NEEDS REAL DATA: road times from Barabanki, Unnao, Sitapur and Hardoi, checked on a map with a date","source":"","asOf":""}]'::jsonb, 'For readers in Lucknow and nearby districts planning a hydrafacial around summer heat, sweat and sun, wedding dates and a single day trip, with a quote checklist.', '{}'::jsonb, false, '[]'::jsonb, '["In Lucknow the main local points are summer sweat and sun after a session, and wedding dates.","From a nearby town, a short session means a long trip, so plan one day around it.","Local skin clinics and salons both provide sessions, and the checks are the same."]'::jsonb, null, '[{"heading":"Areas people ask about","text":"People often ask about clinics in Gomti Nagar, Hazratganj and Indira Nagar. We name no clinic. Pick by how easily you can get there and by the answers to the questions on this page."},{"heading":"Sweat and sun after a session","text":"Skin is more sensitive to sun for a day or two. Avoid being outdoors in the afternoon, wear a cap or carry an umbrella, and use the sun protection the clinic advises."},{"heading":"Marriage season","text":"Lucknow fills with events through the winter wedding season. Book a trial session well before your date, and avoid trying a new serum or facial in the final week."},{"heading":"Hindi first","text":"Hindi and Hinglish are fine at most clinics. Ask for the quote to be explained in the language you read most easily. {tbc}"}]'::jsonb, 'Hydrafacial in Lucknow: Cost, Downtime, Risks', 'Hydrafacial in Lucknow', 'A hydrafacial in Lucknow is a skin-care session of under an hour, with pink skin for a few hours. The local price is {tbc} until quotes are collected. Summer sweat and sun are the main local points, and visitors from nearby towns can plan one trip around it.', '[{"heading":"One trip, one session","paragraphs":["A hydrafacial is a one-session treatment for most people, so the trip is the cost to plan. From Unnao or Sitapur, the visit is a half day or more. Book the earliest slot, and ask the clinic how long you will be there, including the skin check.","Ask whether the pack price makes sense for you if each visit is a day of travel. A pack of sessions is cheaper per session on paper, and it commits you to more trips and more spending before you know how your skin reacts."]},{"heading":"Hot dry summers and humid monsoon","paragraphs":["Lucknow summers are hot and dry, and the monsoon is humid. Heat and sweat on freshly exfoliated skin can sting, and humid weeks can bring breakouts after a session in some people. Ask the person who performs it what to do in each season.","Winter mornings can be foggy and cool, and cool dry weeks may leave skin tight after a session. A moisturiser and sun protection matter in every season."]},{"heading":"Water from the Gomti and the tap","paragraphs":["Households use a mix of piped supply and groundwater, and hardness varies by area. We do not claim that water changes how a session works. If your skin feels tight after washing at home, tell the clinic, and ask them for a gentle cleanser."]},{"heading":"Who performs it, and how to ask","paragraphs":["Both clinics and salons provide hydrafacial sessions in Lucknow. A doctor-led clinic can check for sunburn, infection or irritated skin before starting. A salon may not. Ask who performs the session and what training they have, and ask for tips and tools to be new or cleaned in front of you.","If a person says that everyone can have the session, take that as a reason to ask for details, since some skin conditions and medicines mean you should wait."]},{"heading":"Events, festivals and timing","paragraphs":["Diwali, Eid and wedding season bring crowds to markets and clinics. Book early, and keep a gap of a few weeks before any family event for a trial session. If your skin reacts, you will have time for it to settle."]}]'::jsonb),
