d vehicle.","roadTimes":[{"from":"Unnao","time":"30 to 60 min","tip":"Close enough for a same-day session"},{"from":"Kanpur Dehat","time":"40 to 80 min","tip":"An early slot avoids afternoon heat"},{"from":"Fatehpur","time":"70 to 110 min","tip":"Combine the visit with other errands"},{"from":"Lucknow","time":"100 to 150 min","tip":"The other city we cover, so compare before you travel"}],"privacyNote":"In a mid-sized city many people know each other. A short session need not be explained, and a clinic should not name it on messages.","mapCaption":"Travel into Kanpur from nearby towns, and the road to Lucknow, no building shown."}'::jsonb, '[{"text":"NEEDS REAL DATA: whether any partner facility exists in Kanpur for skin-care sessions","source":"","asOf":""},{"text":"NEEDS REAL DATA: Kanpur road time to Lucknow, from a map with a date","source":"","asOf":""},{"text":"NEEDS REAL DATA: Kanpur air quality record (public CPCB station data) and tap water quality","source":"","asOf":""}]'::jsonb, 'For readers in Kanpur and nearby towns who find few published prices for a hydrafacial and need a way to ask for a written quote, with notes on who performs the session, dust and cold winters.', '{}'::jsonb, false, '[]'::jsonb, '["In Kanpur few places publish prices, so the first job is to ask for a written quote.","Dust and cold winters shape what skin feels like after a session.","Lucknow is the nearest other city we cover, and a trip there needs to earn its time."]'::jsonb, null, '[{"heading":"Asking for a written quote","text":"Few places in Kanpur publish a price list. Message or call and ask for the base session, each serum, each booster and any pack in writing. Keep the reply, and ask the same of two other places."},{"heading":"Is a trip to Lucknow worth it","text":"For a single session, usually not, unless you are going to Lucknow anyway. A day of road time costs more than the difference in a quote. Compare before you travel."},{"heading":"Cold dry winters","text":"Kanpur winters are cold and dry, and exfoliated skin can feel tight. Ask for a moisturiser that suits you, and avoid hot water on your face for a day."},{"heading":"Dust and industrial air","text":"Kanpur is an industrial city, and people ask whether dust affects skin after a session. We make no claim. Ask the person who performs it what to wear outdoors afterwards and how to clean your face. {pending}"}]'::jsonb, 'Hydrafacial in Kanpur: Cost, Downtime, Risks', 'Hydrafacial in Kanpur', 'A hydrafacial in Kanpur is a skin-care session of under an hour, with pink skin for a few hours. The local price is {tbc} until quotes are collected. Few places in Kanpur publish prices, so this page focuses on how to ask for a quote and who performs the session.', '[{"heading":"When prices are hard to find","paragraphs":["Kanpur has fewer published prices for a hydrafacial than larger cities. That makes a written quote the main tool. Ask for it before you book, and ask for the same lines in each quote: the base session, each serum, each booster, and the pack total beside the per-session price.","When we collect real quotes for Kanpur, this page will show a dated range and the number of sources. Until then the price is a pending figure, and no number from another city stands in for it."]},{"heading":"Who performs it matters more here","paragraphs":["With fewer choices, it is easier to accept the first place that fits your budget. Pause and ask who will perform the session and what training they have. Ask whether tips are single-use. Ask what happens if your skin reacts and who you call.","A doctor-led clinic can check your skin and advise you to wait. A place without a skin check may follow a fixed routine for everyone, and that is a reason to ask more questions."]},{"heading":"Cold winters and hot dusty summers","paragraphs":["Kanpur has cold winters and hot summers. In winter, exfoliated skin feels dry and tight. In summer, sweat and dust mean skin should be cleaned gently and covered outdoors for a day. Ask for aftercare that fits the month you book in."]},{"heading":"Water and the face wash you use","paragraphs":["Water supply in the city mixes the river, piped supply and groundwater, and hardness differs by neighbourhood. We do not claim that water changes how a session works. If skin feels tight after washing, tell the person who performs it, and ask for a gentle cleanser."]},{"heading":"Language, referrals and a second opinion","paragraphs":["Hindi and Hinglish are common in Kanpur clinics. If you have a skin condition, ask your family doctor or dermatologist whether a hydrafacial suits you before you pay. A short note from them helps the person performing the session.","Winter fog can slow roads and trains to Lucknow. If you do travel, build in time and avoid a long ride straight after a session, when skin is pink and sensitive."]}]'::jsonb),
