ard exercise and heat on the same evening unless the doctor says otherwise."},{"heading":"The morning after","text":"Small bruises can show the next day. If you have a presentation or a meeting, plan the visit so that you are not in front of people on the following morning."},{"heading":"Cyber City and Golf Course Road","text":"People working in these corridors often want a clinic nearby. Choose by the doctor and the product checks first, and by distance second."}]'::jsonb, 'Botulinum Toxin Injections in Gurgaon: Cost and Risks', 'Botulinum toxin injections in Gurgaon', 'Botulinum toxin injections in Gurgaon (also written Gurugram) are a short visit with a doctor after a consultation. The local sample range per area is {tbc} until quotes are collected. Most people here plan the visit around office hours, so slot times and the first-day advice matter.', '[{"heading":"Fitting a short visit around the office","paragraphs":["The injection takes a short time. What takes longer is the consultation, the consent and the wait afterwards. Ask the clinic how long the whole visit takes, and book a slot that lets you go home afterwards rather than back to a desk.","If you need a review visit at about two weeks, book it at the same time as the first, so it does not slip. A review that is missed means a result that nobody has checked."]},{"heading":"Heat, air conditioning and what to tell the doctor","paragraphs":["Summers in Gurgaon run from April into September and are hot. Offices are cold and dry. The doctor may advise you to avoid heat and hard exercise on the first day, and sun protection afterwards. We make no claim that climate changes how the medicine works.","If you travel a lot for work, tell the doctor. A long flight soon after the visit is a question for the doctor and not for a general page."]},{"heading":"Water is not a factor here","paragraphs":["Groundwater in parts of Gurugram is described as hard or salty. It has no known bearing on this treatment. Wash your face as the doctor advises on the first day, and use your usual routine after that."]},{"heading":"Referral habits and who to ask","paragraphs":["People in Gurgaon often ask colleagues and friends for a clinic name, and a name from a colleague is not a check. Ask for the doctor''s registration and the plan in writing, and compare at least two places.","A second opinion from a dermatologist you already see is a good step. It costs a consultation and can save a plan you did not need."]},{"heading":"Monsoon and the review visit","paragraphs":["Heavy rain can cause long delays on the roads in July and August. Leave extra time for the visit and for the review, and ask the clinic how to reschedule the review without losing the point of it."]}]'::jsonb),
